#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:52
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kde; Visual Dictionary of terms"
msgstr "Motlî vizuwel des mots d'&nbsp;&kde;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:54
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This project was started to help unify the vocabulary used in &kde; "
"documentation."
msgstr ""
"Ci pordjet ci a stî enondé po-z unifyî l'&nbsp;motlî eployî dins l'&nbsp;"
"documintåcion di &kde;."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:57
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"We provide this for you here as an aid to learning your way around the &kde; "
"Graphical User Interface. These names have been standardized within &kde; "
"documentation, so that you will always find interface items referred to in "
"the same way."
msgstr ""
"Nos vs dinant çoula come ene aidance po vs afaiti avou l'&nbsp;eterface "
"grafike di &kde;. Ces nos la ont stî standårdijhîs å dvins del documintåcion "
"di &kde;, po tofer aveur les minmes cayets lomés del minme manire."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:63
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The term <quote>Widget</quote> refers to the basic building block of a "
"computer program's interface."
msgstr ""
"Li mot <quote>ahesse</quote> (<quote>widget</quote> en inglès) c'&nbsp;est "
"l'&nbsp;no k'&nbsp;on dene al brike di costrujhaedje di båze di l'&nbsp;"
"eterface grafike des programes."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Each widget operates in a similar manner each time it is used, but the "
"effect that the widget has depends on its place within the program."
msgstr ""
"Tchaeke ahesse si kidût d'&nbsp;ene minme manire tchaeke côp k'&nbsp;elle "
"est eployeye, mins les efet d'&nbsp;l'&nbsp;ahesse vont dipinde di si plaece "
"dins l'&nbsp;programe."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid "Listing of Common &kde; Widgets"
msgstr "Djivêye des comonès ahesses di &kde;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Currently, this guide consists of a table of the names of the graphical "
"elements often found in &kde; documentation, and an example of each one."
msgstr ""
"Pol moumint, ci guide ci c'&nbsp;est djusse on tåvlea des nos des elemints "
"grafikes k'&nbsp;on ndè cåze sovint dins l'&nbsp;documintåcion di &kde;, "
"avou ene imådje d'&nbsp;egzimpe po tchaeke."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Our hope, eventually, is to make this a much more complete document, which "
"will take you on a visual tour of &kde;."
msgstr ""
"Nos vôréns fé d'&nbsp;çouchal on documint bén pus complet, ki vs frè fé on "
"toû vizuwel di l'&nbsp;evironmint d'&nbsp;buro &kde;."

